{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for RadianceAI', 'description': 'Primary container for RadianceAI implementation: GlowSkin is a modern, interactive skincare recommendation and routine builder web app. Users take a quiz about their skin type, goals, and budget. The app fetches best-selling products from APIs, generates personalized morning and night routines, and displays detailed product cards. Users can also interact with an AI chatbot to get personalized answers. Users can save routines, track progress, and receive weather-based suggestions. The UI is Apple-like, smooth, and animated with Framer Motion. Data is stored locally or in Firebase. Email and geolocation APIs enhance personalization.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "RadianceAI-36090 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Personalized Skincare Quiz",\n      "description": "Short quiz for users to input skin type, goals, and budget, forming the basis for routine recommendations.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "API-Driven Product Recommendations",\n      "description": "Fetches best-selling and relevant skincare products from DummyJSON and RapidAPI, mapped to routine steps (cleanser, serum, etc.).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Routine Builder",\n      "description": "Generates a multi-step morning and night skincare routine tailored to user input and product data.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Detailed Product Cards",\n      "description": "Displays product name, brand, image, price, rating, key ingredients, usage tips, and official links in expandable, animated cards.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Routine Saving & Progress Tracker",\n      "description": "Users can save routines, log product start dates, and visually track weekly progress. Data stored in LocalStorage or Firebase.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Weather-Based Suggestions",\n      "description": "Integrates with OpenWeatherMap to suggest products based on local weather (e.g., hydration for dry weather).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Email Reminders & Summaries",\n      "description": "Uses EmailJS to send users their routine summary or reminders.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Geolocation-Based Customization",\n      "description": "Detects user region via IP Geolocation API to tailor product suggestions and store links.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive, Animated UI",\n      "description": "Apple-like, smooth, interactive UI with scroll-based transitions and Framer Motion animations. Fully responsive across devices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "AI Chatbot",\n      "description": "An AI Chatbot which helps user to build a routine,understand their skin type and recommend products",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#FADADD",\n    "secondary": "#e7b3ff",\n    "accent": "#f339db"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The home page features a hero section with a soft, elegant background and a prominent call-to-action. Below, best-selling products are displayed in a horizontally scrollable, animated carousel. The quiz is presented as a multi-step, animated modal. Routine results are shown in a card-based, expandable layout with smooth transitions. Progress tracker and saved routines are accessible from a persistent bottom navigation bar. All UI elements use soft shadows, rounded corners, and subtle motion effects for a premium feel."\n}'}",
